  "title": "Jazzy Juicy Argentinian Tamarind Stew",
  "description": "A funky, juicy stew with a tamarind ball and rendered vegan bacon that tastes like a hangover cure. It’s packed with bright veggies and earthy spices for a satisfying lunch.",
