  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and minced garlic and sauté until translucent.",
    "Add the vegan bacon slices and cook until they brown and release their fat.",
    "Stir in the diced carrot and bell pepper and cook for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, vegetable broth, and soy sauce, then stir to combine.",
    "Break the tamarind ball into small pieces and fold it into the stew.",
    "Season with smoked paprika, cumin, salt, and pepper.",
    "Bring the mixture to a gentle boil, then reduce heat to low.",
    "Simmer uncovered for 30 minutes, stirring occasionally to prevent sticking.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed, then serve hot over rice or crusty bread."
  ],
